    "summary": "Interior of a bright modern property office at midday. EXACTLY THREE PEOPLE are present throughout and the number never changes: a young female cleaner in a navy housekeeping uniform standing still on the near side of a dark wooden desk, a middle-aged male property manager in a white shirt and charcoal waistcoat who strides two paces and slams his palm on the desk, and a young female colleague in a light-grey cleaning uniform standing motionless against the far LEFT corner wall. The left-hand door stays closed and the doorway stays empty — no one enters, no one leaves, no one is duplicated. Venetian-blind light bands fall across the room.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot inside the office: 钱经理 (S3) strides two paces in from the near end of the room, 小唐 (S4) one pace behind him, and he slams his palm flat on the long wooden desk; the grey metal filing cabinets fill the wall behind him.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he leans his weight onto the desk and opens his mouth, speaking in a loud bullying nasal Mandarin: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her; she stands with her back to the camera and does not move her feet.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:06.200, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the near end of the desk as 苏小满 (S1) sets both hands flat on the desk top and slides the folder she was carrying onto it; 钱经理 (S3) watches the folder come down.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.200, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on the folder lying flat on the desk between them; both of their hands stay flat on the wood either side of it.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office: 钱经理 (S3) still bearing down on the desk across from 苏小满 (S1), 小唐 (S4) standing clear of the desk end, the room very quiet.\n\nFrom [Shot 3] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is the one line 钱经理 (S3) has already delivered in [Shot 2]; the office falls into room tone.\n\nNo slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "soundscape": "A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; one sharp heel strike at 0.3s as 钱经理 strides in; a flat palm slap on the desk top at 1.2s; the scrape of a folder sliding across wood at 7.0s; room tone returns at 9.4s.",
    "music": "A low sustained string drone enters at 0s, a single wood-block knock lands with the palm slap at 1.2s, and the track thins to one held note from 8.2s onward.",
    "anchor": "The whole clip takes place in one small private office and the camera never leaves it. The room has four plain white walls, a grey metal filing cabinet along the far wall, a long wooden desk standing across the middle of the floor, venetian blinds on the right-hand wall laying bright bands across the desk top, and a closed wooden door set flat into the back wall. The walls behind the people are smooth painted plaster of one single light colour, unbroken from the skirting board up to the ceiling. All cardboard boxes and folders are plain brown corrugated cardboard. The people named in this beat are the only people in it: the manager stays behind the desk on the far side, the cleaner stays at the near end of it with her back to the camera, and the colleague stands where this beat places her. The count does not change.",
    "crowd": false,
    "ref_notes": {
      "office_pano": "the property office of 万山大厦 seen empty, used for LAYOUT, FURNITURE and DAYLIGHT reference ONLY. Do NOT copy any person, figure, silhouette or body part that happens to be visible in this picture — the people in this shot come only from <Subject 1>, <Subject 2> and <Subject 3>. The room contains no other human being."
    },
    "style_pack": "lean",
    "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot inside the office: 钱经理 (S3) strides two paces in from the near end of the room, 小唐 (S4) one pace behind him, and he slams his palm flat on the long wooden desk; the grey metal filing cabinets fill the wall behind him.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he leans his weight onto the desk and opens his mouth, speaking in a loud bullying nasal Mandarin: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her; she stands with her back to the camera and does not move her feet.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:06.200, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the near end of the desk as 苏小满 (S1) sets both hands flat on the desk top and slides the folder she was carrying onto it; 钱经理 (S3) watches the folder come down.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.200, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on the folder lying flat on the desk between them; both of their hands stay flat on the wood either side of it.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office: 钱经理 (S3) still bearing down on the desk across from 苏小满 (S1), 小唐 (S4) standing clear of the desk end, the room very quiet.\n\nFrom [Shot 3] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is the one line 钱经理 (S3) has already delivered in [Shot 2]; the office falls into room tone.\n\nNo slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot inside the office: 钱经理 (S3) strides two paces in from the near end of the room, 小唐 (S4) one pace behind him, and he slams his palm flat on the long wooden desk; the grey metal filing cabinets fill the wall behind him.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he leans his weight onto the desk and opens his mouth, speaking in a loud bullying nasal Mandarin: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her; she stands with her back to the camera and does not move her feet.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:06.200, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the near end of the desk as 苏小满 (S1) sets both hands flat on the desk top and slides the folder she was carrying onto it; 钱经理 (S3) watches the folder come down.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.200, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on the folder lying flat on the desk between them; both of their hands stay flat on the wood either side of it.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office: 钱经理 (S3) still bearing down on the desk across from 苏小满 (S1), 小唐 (S4) standing clear of the desk end, the room very quiet.\n\nFrom [Shot 3] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is the one line 钱经理 (S3) has already delivered in [Shot 2]; the office falls into room tone.\n\nNo slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "lean_anchor": "The whole clip takes place in one small private office and the camera never leaves it. The room has four plain white walls, a grey metal filing cabinet along the far wall, a long wooden desk standing across the middle of the floor, venetian blinds on the right-hand wall laying bright bands across the desk top, and a closed wooden door set flat into the back wall. The walls behind the people are smooth painted plaster of one single light colour, unbroken from the skirting board up to the ceiling. All cardboard boxes and folders are plain brown corrugated cardboard. The people named in this beat are the only people in it: the manager stays behind the desk on the far side, the cleaner stays at the near end of it with her back to the camera, and the colleague stands where this beat places her. The count does not change."
