  {
    "id": "xs01_t02",
    "scene": "1-1",
    "title": "点名",
    "refs": [
      "qianjingli",
      "suxiaoman",
      "xiaotang"
    ],
    "retention": {
      "qianjingli": "fully_preserved - his slicked-back oily hair, round face and dark grey buttoned waistcoat over a white shirt are retained in every shot.",
      "suxiaoman": "fully_preserved - her centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, dark navy button-up work shirt and worn grey apron are retained in every shot.",
      "xiaotang": "fully_preserved - her hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey work shirt and light-grey apron are retained in every shot."
    },
    "summary": "The manager narrows it down to one person, staring across the desk; she denies it flatly and without heat.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the far side with the filing cabinets behind his back, one palm flat on the wood; 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end with her back to the camera; 小唐 (S4) stands against the back wall at the far left of frame, waiting.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he straightens up slowly, tucks both hands behind his back and tips his head to one side, fixing 苏小满 (S1) with the look of a man who has already decided. His mouth opens and he speaks in a flat accusing Mandarin: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her. She does not move her feet and does not look away, and she answers at once in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 不是我。\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the end of the desk as 钱经理 (S3) finishes the accusation and stops, and his eyes leave her; he turns his head and shoulders toward the left-hand wall. 苏小满 (S1) stays where she is, following him with her eyes.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on 钱经理 (S3)'s face as he turns his head fully left and looks straight at 小唐 (S4) against the wall; the look lasts a beat and says everything. 小唐 (S4) sees it and pushes off the wall with her shoulder, taking the first step forward.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office as 钱经理 (S3) gives one short jerk of his chin toward the open floor beside the desk. 苏小满 (S1) has gone very still, watching the colleague approach.\n\nFrom [Shot 4] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is 钱经理 (S3) swallowing; every line of dialogue has already finished, and the office falls into room tone.\n\nNo slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "soundscape": "A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a short inhale from 钱经理 at 2.3s before he speaks; one nervous swallow from 小唐 at 8.5s; the soft scrape of a shoe on the floor at 9.0s as she steps forward.",
    "music": "A low sustained string drone begins at 0s and thins to a single held note from 8.5s, ending on a short cello pulse as the colleague steps forward.",
    "crowd": false,
    "style_pack": "lean",
