    "summary": "Pressed from the wall, the young colleague gives a deliberately vague testimony, and the manager takes it as proof.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium three-shot: 钱经理 (S3) stands behind the desk facing the camera with one palm flat on the wood; 小唐 (S4) stands on the open floor beside the desk, a pace in from its near end, her hands folded low; 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end of that desk with her back to the camera.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.400, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3)'s face as he finishes looking at 小唐 (S4) and turns his eyes to her face, waiting; he lifts one hand off the desk and turns it over, palm up, a short beckoning motion. His mouth stays shut through it.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:03.800, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging to a closer single on 小唐 (S4) standing on the open floor: she draws her shoulders up, keeps her eyes on the floor tiles and lets them flick once toward 苏小满 (S1), then away, and she speaks in a small thin nervous Mandarin: [Chinese] 钱经理。中午，我看见她往兜里塞东西。没看清。\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.400, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving from 小唐 (S4) around to 苏小满 (S1) at the near end of the desk, showing the distance between the two of them across the open floor.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.800, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on 苏小满 (S1)'s face as she turns her head a few degrees toward 小唐 (S4) and holds there, her jaw setting.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.500, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing all three of them in the office: the manager behind the desk, the colleague on the open floor, the cleaner at the near end of the desk with her back turned. All three hold their positions.\n\nFrom [Shot 4] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is 小唐 (S4) finishing the one line she has already delivered; the office falls into room tone.\n\nNo slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "soundscape": "A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a small clearing of throat from 小唐 at 4.4s before she speaks; one sharp breath from 苏小满 at 8.6s; room tone settles at 9.5s.",
    "music": "A low sustained string drone begins at 0s, a single muted piano note enters at 2.4s when the manager beckons, and the track thins from 8.8s to one held note.",
    "crowd": false,
