    "summary": "The cleaner turns the accusation back on the witness; the girl retreats into her own certainty.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the far side facing the camera, 苏小满 (S1) at the near end with her back to the camera, the filing cabinets directly behind him.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.200, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he plants both palms on the desk and leans forward; his mouth opens and he speaks in a loud nasal Mandarin: [Chinese] 你今天把话说清楚。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.400, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her. She turns her head and shoulders toward 小唐 (S4) off to the left of frame and speaks quietly in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:06.800, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the desk end toward 小唐 (S4), who takes one small step and then stops.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.200, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on 小唐 (S4)'s face as her eyes drop to the floor and her shoulders come up.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the three of them holding their positions across the office floor, all of them very still.\n\nFrom [Shot 4] through [Shot 6] no mouth moves in frame; every line has already been delivered, and the office falls into room tone.\n\nNo slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "soundscape": "A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a hard knuckle tap on the desk top at 2.0s; one small shoe step at 6.8s; room tone returns at 9.4s.",
    "music": "A low sustained string drone begins at 0s, a single wood-block knock lands at 2.0s with the knuckle tap, and one held cello note sustains from 8.2s.",
