    "shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the far side with one palm flat on the wood; 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end with her back to the camera; 小唐 (S4) stands clear at the far left of frame near the back wall.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.200, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he turns his palm up over the desk in a flat demanding gesture and speaks in a loud nasal Mandarin: [Chinese] 兜掏出来。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across to a closer single on 苏小满 (S1) at the near end of the desk; her hands stay at her own waist and she does not step forward.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:06.000, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving to show the open floor between 钱经理 (S3) and 苏小满 (S1), the distance neither of them crosses.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:07.800, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on 苏小满 (S1)'s hands at her waist as her fingers go into her apron pocket and come out with a small folded paper, which she lays flat on the desk.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office: the folded paper lying flat on the desk between the two of them, and 小唐 (S4) still standing clear at the far left of frame. All three hold their positions.\n\nFrom [Shot 3] through [Shot 6] no mouth moves in frame; every line has already been delivered, and the office falls into room tone.\n\nNo slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
